  id: S-14
  lines:
  - speaker: "Lonca K\xE2tibi Nevin"
    text: "S\u0131nav k\xE2\u011F\u0131tlar\u0131 m\xFCh\xFCrl\xFC, kimse g\xF6rmedi."
  - speaker: "G\xFCvercinci Selim"
    text: "Ezberleyen ge\xE7emez diyorlar, do\u011Fru mu?"
  - speaker: "Lonca K\xE2tibi Nevin"
    text: "Yanl\u0131\u015F yapan ba\u015Fka soru al\u0131r. Ezber i\u015Fe yaramaz,
      anlamak gerek."
